OL,3,GNEWSARecord numbers apply to service
OL,4,Aafter heath blaze
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fire service has received a record
OL,7,Fnumber of applications to be on-call
OL,8,Fofficers since a major nature reserve
OL,9,Fblaze captured national attention in
OL,10,Fthe summer.
OL,12,FA major incident was declared at
OL,13,FDunwich Heath on the Suffolk coast in
OL,14,FJuly as fire devastated the dry,
OL,15,FNational Trust heathland.
OL,17,FThe latest county fire service campaign
OL,18,Fhas seen the number of applicants reach
OL,19,F219 - more than double the 70-100 the
OL,20,Fservice said it would typically receive
OL,21,Facross all six annual appeals.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,380,370,200,160,0,100
