OL,3,GNEWSARecord numbers apply to service
OL,4,Aafter heath blaze
OL,5,
OL,6,FJon Lacey, chief fire officer, said it
OL,7,Fwas "an exceptional result... it
OL,8,Fdemonstrates the strong community
OL,9,Fspirit that exists across Suffolk".
